#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:1
msgid ""
"BM Generation: Data Generation with a Fully Connected Boltzmann Machine"
msgstr "BM 生成：全连接玻尔兹曼机数据生成"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial extends the RBM idea to a fully connected Boltzmann Machine "
"(BM), where all nodes are connected (not just across layers). It "
"demonstrates how to train a BM with a mixed KL-divergence + conditional "
"likelihood objective and generate samples from it. The system architecture "
"and sampling interface are introduced in [Introduction](../introduction.md) "
"and [Quick Start](../quickstart.md); the theoretical background is covered "
"in [Section 4.1: The Classic Boltzmann Machine](../../theoretical-"
"foundations/kpp-theoretical-foundations-bm-overall.md). This tutorial "
"focuses on what changes when moving from an RBM to a BM: the new objective "
"terms and conditional sampling that a fully connected graph requires."
msgstr ""
"本教程将 RBM 的思路扩展到全连接玻尔兹曼机（BM），其中所有节点都相互连接（而不仅仅是跨层连接）。本教程演示如何使用混合 KL 散度 + "
"条件似然目标训练 "
"BM，并从中生成样本。系统架构与采样接口已在[简介](../introduction.md)和[快速入门](../quickstart.md)中介绍；理论背景请参阅[第"
" 4.1 节：经典玻尔兹曼机](../../theoretical-foundations/kpp-theoretical-foundations-"
"bm-overall.md)。本教程重点关注从 RBM 迁移到 BM 时的变化：全连接图所需的新目标项与条件采样。"

