#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:55
msgid "The training objective combines two terms:"
msgstr "训练目标由两项组成："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:57
msgid ""
"**KL divergence**: encourages the model distribution to match the data "
"distribution (unsupervised generation)."
msgstr "**KL 散度**：鼓励模型分布与数据分布匹配（无监督生成）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:58
msgid ""
"**Negative conditional likelihood (NCL)**: when part of the visible units "
"are designated as outputs (`num_output`), the model must reconstruct those "
"outputs given the rest."
msgstr "**负条件似然（NCL）**：当部分可见单元被指定为输出（`num_output`）时，模型必须在给定其余输入的条件下重建这些输出。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:60
msgid "The combined objective is:"
msgstr "组合目标为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{KL\\_divergence} + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{NCL}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{KL\\_divergence} + (1 - \\alpha) \\cdot \\text{NCL}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:66
msgid "where $\\alpha$ is set via `cost_param[\"alpha\"]`."
msgstr "其中 $\\alpha$ 由 `cost_param[\"alpha\"]` 控制，平衡生成能力与条件一致性。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:68
msgid ""
"**Negative phase**: `bm_net.sample(worker)` draws a complete joint "
"visible+hidden state from the current BM distribution, approximating the "
"model distribution for the contrastive divergence objective."
msgstr ""
"**负相**：`bm_net.sample(worker)` 从当前 BM 分布中采样完整的联合可见+隐状态，用于近似对比散度目标中的模型分布。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:70
msgid ""
"**Positive phase**: the positive phase uses two conditional samplings per "
"batch:"
msgstr "**正相**：正相对每个批次执行两类条件采样："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:72
msgid ""
"**Full conditional**: the entire input batch is fixed as the visible layer, "
"and the corresponding joint state is sampled."
msgstr "**完整条件**：将整个输入批次固定为可见层，采样对应的联合状态。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:73
msgid ""
"**Partial conditional**: only the non-output portion of the input (`data[:, "
":-num_output]`) is fixed, and the output dimensions are sampled freely."
msgstr "**部分条件**：仅固定输入的非输出部分（`data[:, :-num_output]`），输出维度自由采样。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:75
msgid ""
"These two samplings compute the KL term and the NCL term respectively. A "
"cosine schedule with linear warmup stabilizes early training. Multi-process "
"sampling splits each batch across workers, running positive-phase "
"conditional sampling in parallel to accelerate the training loop. All "
"sampling operations are embedded in the PyTorch computation graph, enabling "
"end-to-end backpropagation."
msgstr ""
"这两类采样分别计算 KL 项和 NCL 项。带线性 warmup 的余弦调度稳定训练初期。多进程采样将每个批次拆分到多个 "
"worker，并行执行正相条件采样以加速训练循环。所有采样操作嵌入 PyTorch 计算图，支持端到端反向传播。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/bm_generation.md:77
msgid ""
"The `num_output` parameter designates which visible units are \"outputs\" "
"(e.g. labels in a supervised setting), enabling conditional generation — you"
" can fix part of the visible units and let the model generate the rest."
msgstr "`num_output` 参数指定哪些可见单元为\"输出\"（如监督设定中的标签），实现条件生成——您可以固定部分可见单元，让模型生成其余部分。"

